{"document_id": 117, "sha256": "05e6e623a008353e6a94dec66e699fe82c1537c676bf34e65bf6f70328b02fe7", "agency": "fda", "doc_type": "approval_letter", "program_id": "stelara", "engine": "prep-1.4+docling2.137.0+tables-accurate+repair1+pictables1", "watermarks_removed": 0, "routes": [{"page": 1, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=1759"}, {"page": 2, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=2106"}, {"page": 3, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=592"}, {"page": 4, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=533"}], "blocks": [{"type": "picture", "ref": "#/pictures/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [71.0, 720.1, 264.1, 756.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "caption": "", "text": "", "status": "kept", "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 671.2, 173.5, 682.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "BLA 125261/S-174", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/1", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 574.6, 258.9, 641.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Janssen Biotech, Inc. Attention: Michelle Godin MS, RAC Associate Director 800 Ridgeview Drive Horsham, PA 19044", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/2", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 547.0, 184.2, 558.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Dear Michelle Godin:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/3", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 491.8, 513.0, 530.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Please refer to your supplemental biologics license application (sBLA) received March 27, 2026, submitted under section 351(a)of the Public Health Service Act for Stelara (ustekinumab) injection.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/4", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 450.4, 488.4, 475.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "This Prior Approval sBLA provides for revisions to labeling to include alpha-gal sensitization associated with hypersensitivity.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/5", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 422.5, 215.4, 434.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "APPROVAL & LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/6", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 367.6, 535.6, 406.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have completed our review of this application, as amended. It is approved, effective on the date of this letter, for use as recommended in the enclosed agreed-upon labeling.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/7", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 339.7, 214.7, 351.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "CONTENT OF LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/8", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 243.4, 533.3, 323.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "As soon as possible, but no later than 14 days from the date of this letter, submit, via the FDA automated drug registration and listing system (eLIST), the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.14(b)] in structured product labeling (SPL) format, as described at FDA.gov, 1 that is identical to the enclosed labeling (text for the Prescribing Information, and Medication Guide) and include the labeling changes proposed in any pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/9", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 201.9, 528.4, 227.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Information on submitting SPL files using eLIST may be found in guidance for industry SPL Standard for Content of Labeling Technical Qs and As. 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/10", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 174.4, 441.0, 185.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "The SPL will be accessible via publicly available labeling repositories.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/11", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 117.9, 456.8, 127.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "1 http://www.fda.gov/ForIndustry/DataStandards/StructuredProductLabeling/default.htm", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/12", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 83.4, 534.4, 104.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "2 We update guidances periodically. For the most recent version of a guidance, check the FDA Guidance Documents Database https://www.fda.gov/RegulatoryInformation/Guidances/default.htm.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/13", "parent": "#/groups/0", "page": 1, "bbox": [10.0, 8.3, 92.7, 15.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 5834663", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/14", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [388.0, 657.1, 540.0, 668.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/15", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 742.0, 173.5, 753.3], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 125261/S-174", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/16", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 728.2, 110.1, 739.5], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/17", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 594.8, 539.0, 702.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Also within 14 days, amend all pending supplemental applications that include labeling changes for this BLA, including pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements, for which FDA has not yet issued an action letter, with the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.12(f)] in Microsoft Word format that includes the changes approved in this supplemental application, as well as annual reportable changes. To facilitate review of your submission(s), provide a highlighted or marked-up copy that shows all changes, as well as a clean Microsoft Word version. The marked-up copy should provide appropriate annotations, including supplement number(s) and annual report date(s).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/18", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 566.8, 235.3, 578.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/19", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 484.4, 502.4, 550.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "You may request advisory comments on proposed introductory advertising and promotional labeling. For information about submitting promotional materials, see guidance for industry Providing Regulatory Submissions in Electronic and NonElectronic Format-Promotional Labeling and Advertising Materials for Human Prescription Drugs.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/20", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 415.5, 533.2, 468.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "You must submit final promotional materials and Prescribing Information, accompanied by a Form FDA 2253, at the time of initial dissemination or publication [21 CFR 601.12(f)(4)]. Form FDA 2253 is available at FDA.gov. 3 Information and Instructions for completing the form can be found at FDA.gov. 4", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/21", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 387.5, 243.4, 399.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REPORTING REQUIREMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/22", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 346.5, 531.8, 371.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that you must comply with reporting requirements for an approved BLA (in 21 CFR 600.80 and in 21 CFR 600.81).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/23", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 277.5, 532.4, 330.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Your product is a Part 3 combination product (21 CFR 3.2(e)); therefore, you must also comply with postmarketing safety reporting requirements for an approved combination product (21 CFR 4, Subpart B). Additional information on combination product postmarketing safety reporting is available at FDA.gov.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/24", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 83.5, 470.0, 93.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "3 http://www.fda.gov/downloads/AboutFDA/ReportsManualsForms/Forms/UCM083570.pdf", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/25", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 71.9, 470.0, 81.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "4 http://www.fda.gov/downloads/AboutFDA/ReportsManualsForms/Forms/UCM375154.pdf", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/26", "parent": "#/groups/1", "page": 2, "bbox": [10.0, 8.3, 92.7, 15.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 5834663", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/27", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 47.4, 238.5, 68.3], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "U.S. Food and Drug Administration Silver Spring, MD 20993", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/28", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 35.6, 133.7, 45.3], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "www.fda.gov", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "reg